<title>UK: Brent trades steady at July -48 cts, sole date kep.</title>
<headline>Brent trades steady at July -48 cts, sole date kep.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Brent cargo loading June 12-14 was traded at July Brent -48 cents on Thursday afternoon, steady on a deal done on Wednesday for a June 10-12 cargo.</p>
<p>The sole Brent date nominated from the paper chains on Thursday was kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline by Stasco, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo is scheduled to load June 20-22.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
